libc++ (LLVM 18) std::visit(F, variant<int, char>): the body of std::visit is
dropped.  Layers fixed so far: the declaration's default template argument
(cpp11_default_template_argument_from_earlier_declaration), a friend of a
base class (cpp11_friend_of_base_accesses_member_through_derived), nested
pack expansions (cpp11_function_parameter_pack_in_nested_expansion).
Remaining: __make_fmatrix_impl<_Fp, _Vs...>(index_sequence<>{}, ...)
(cpp11_explicit_pack_arguments_before_deduced_pack).  clang++ 18
-stdlib=libc++ accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
